        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D07-K360 Netropol Collection Door Knob</b>\r\n<p>\r\nEnter the modern age with this mushroom shaped knob style made popular be the Earle Hardware Co. around 1935.  Simple design, yet goes with many back plate styles.  Finishes well in solid finishes like Oil Rubbed Bronze, Polished Brass, Satin Nickel, and Weathered Finishes.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<B>Specifications</B> of Brass Accents D07-K360 Netropol Door Knob\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard 2-1/8\" Pre-Drilled Doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available in 13 Finishes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<B>Available Functions</B> Netropol Decorative Door Knob\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Double Dummy: Stationary both sides of door</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
